ind":"announcement","title":"Mechanis Obscura Wins Two Awards at HEGA (Day Zero category)","summary":"I’m proud to share that Mechanis Obscura made its very first public appearance at the Hellenic Game Awards (Day Zero, Gameathlon 2025) — and was honored with both awards of the category:🏆 Grand Prix – Best Game (Day Zero) 🏆 Audience Choice – Public Vote Winner (Day Zero)As a solo-developed project, this debut works as a big boost! Mechanis Obscura has been a journey of puzzles, story, FMV cutscenes, and ARG elements built piece by piece — and to see it recognized right from the start is both hum","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-30T07:29:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772401459","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4018410-1811772772401035","game_id":"steam-4018410","kind":"announcement","title":"Mechanis Obscura Debut at Gameathlon 2025","summary":"I’m thrilled to share that Mechanis Obscura will make its very first public appearance at Gameathlon 2025 (Sept 12–14), competing in the Hellenic Game Awards (Day Zero category). This will be the debut of Mechanis Obscura and it will be available to judges, playtesters, and the audience to try the upcoming demo.I can’t wait to meet fellow players, devs, and friends at the event — and to finally show the game to the public for the very first time.See you at Gameathlon!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-30T07:29:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772401035","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4018410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:23Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:23Z","e